Subject: [PATCH] pwm: mediatek: fix regoffset changed to channel-base/width

c95ab56a7ad6 pwm: mediatek: Simplify representation of channel offsets

(cherry picked from commit 80d4f6e9ccd0050046ef5fb37ab13f08d2366349)
